confidence: high
severity: high
expected_result: A single-entity read whose standard projection exceeds the ceiling degrades to the declared brief projection and reports the applied depth; the receipt's estimated_tokens names the omitted result's size.
actual_result: "pm get pm-5t33or --json exits 2 requested_budget_infeasible with estimated_tokens 177 while --depth brief, --depth deep, TOON and --output-budget 20000 all succeed."
