learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-15T09:24:16.169Z","harness:codex",Budget fallback must preserve projection semantics and measure its own recovery disclosure. Use executable field selectors for omitted groups; retrying the same standard depth alone can repeat the fallback. Keep emitted-envelope token accounting distinct from omitted-result estimates to preserve session charging.
